          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product Description",
            "content": "<p>A simple way to get your daily creatine and electrolytes without the mess. Each stick mixes easily into water for fast hydration and performance support. No scooping, no clumping, just grab a stick and go. Perfect for the gym, travel, or daily use.</p>",
